WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:19.691
Rat made some lunch for Toad.

2
00:00:19.692 --> 00:00:23.935
"Soup will help Toad feel better," he thought.

3
00:00:23.936 --> 00:00:27.735
Finally Toad came in the room.

4
00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:31.370
He looked like a real gentleman.

5
00:00:31.371 --> 00:00:37.867
Rat watched Toad sip his soup.

6
00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:40.819
"Now, Toady," Rat said,

7
00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.346
"I don't want to hurt you.

8
00:00:43.347 --> 00:00:45.676
You've suffered a lot."

9
00:00:45.677 --> 00:00:50.538
"Oh yes," said Toad, nodding. "I have."

10
00:00:50.539 --> 00:00:55.535
"But," said Rat, "you are a big fool!"

11
00:00:55.536 --> 00:00:59.164
Toad dropped his spoon.

12
00:00:59.165 --> 00:01:01.427
He was shocked.

13
00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:04.805
"You were thrown in jail," said Rat

14
00:01:04.806 --> 00:01:09.161
"Yes, but—" said Toad. (I escaped!)

15
00:01:09.162 --> 00:01:13.205
"You were put in chains," said Rat.

16
00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:16.472
"Yes, but—" said Toad.

17
00:01:16.473 --> 00:01:18.558
(Not for long!)

18
00:01:18.559 --> 00:01:22.285
"You were chased," said Rat.

19
00:01:22.286 --> 00:01:25.501
"Yes, but—" said Toad.

20
00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:27.339
(I got away!)

21
00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:31.961
"You were thrown in the water," said Rat.

22
00:01:31.962 --> 00:01:35.117
"Yes, but—" said Toad.

23
00:01:35.118 --> 00:01:37.609
(I stole a horse!)

24
00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:43.075
"And all because of a car!" cried Rat.

25
00:01:43.076 --> 00:01:46.542
"Well, I . . ." said Toad.

26
00:01:46.543 --> 00:01:49.226
(It was great fun!)

27
00:01:49.227 --> 00:01:53.185
"Do you know what everyone is saying?" said Rat.

28
00:01:53.186 --> 00:01:57.015
"They're saying my friend is a thief!"

29
00:01:57.016 --> 00:02:00.538
Rat was very upset.

30
00:02:00.539 --> 00:02:03.544
"You're right, Ratty," said Toad.

31
00:02:03.545 --> 00:02:06.414
"I have been very bad."

32
00:02:06.415 --> 00:02:09.874
Toad thought for a moment.

33
00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:14.218
"I will go back to Toad Hall," said Toad.

34
00:02:14.219 --> 00:02:16.913
"And I will live quietly.

35
00:02:16.914 --> 00:02:19.165
No more adventures!"

36
00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:21.731
"What?" cried Rat.

37
00:02:21.732 --> 00:02:25.454
"Haven't you heard?"
